WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,920
Don't run back to me to report to the Commander-in-Chief

2
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,000
Expelled eight hundred people

3
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,680
Five hundred and thirty-six people exist

4
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:15,270
More than two hundred brothers were lost

5
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:17,350
Thanks to 9527

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:18,750
Kill half of the innate

7
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:20,230
Otherwise the task will be difficult to accomplish

8
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:24,160
Counting the dead brothers, the amount of Fusu gold is doubled.

9
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:36,780
Send it to the brothers’ families. Thank you.

10
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,540
Just take what you need

11
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,780
But I still want to thank you

12
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,580
It's good to be brave with swords, right?

13
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:50,600
It's pretty good. I'll give it to you. You don't have to give it back to me. I'm sure.

14
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,240
Of course I'm sure you have this knife

15
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:55,080
But you helped me save many brothers

16
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:03,140
Report to the Commander-in-Chief

17
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,700
There is an urgent mission coming from behind.
